{"message":"Computing the 2004 money pool percentage: money pool activity used $42.5 million of operating cash flows in 2004 (source q0n0), and the December 31, 2004 receivable from the money pool was $61,592 thousand, i.e. $61.592 million (table source t2c0n0). The percentage is money pool use divided by receivables, multiplied by 100.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"42.5 / (61592/1000) * 100","variables":{"use_millions":{"value":"42.5","source":"source:q0n0"},"receivables_thousands":{"value":"61592","source":"source:t2c0n0"}},"sources":{"use_millions":"source:q0n0","receivables_thousands":"source:t2c0n0"}}}